* G1_TOP breaker path, chip level: in-range hard trip: code 200 (~39.25mV), 1.8A/45mV fault in 20ns; HARD_N=4
* case c_mid | block netlists sch | front end tl | clock to the RTL ideal | corner tt (mos_tt res_typ cap_typ hbt_typ) | 27 degC | run_top.py
* blockset c1414 (run_top.py BLOCKSETS); ideal-clock frequency 9.436194721 MHz
* netlist bgr: blocks/g1_bgr/layout/coordinated_full_closure/evidence/pex-preparation-20260922-r1/controls/r1/baseline_586.spice
* netlist sense: blocks/g1_trip/sim/qualification/joint586-softinputpair4-nf4-roomcal-s73133-20260924-r1/sense.spice
* netlist trip: blocks/g1_trip/sim/qualification/joint586-softinputpair4-nf4-roomcal-s73133-20260924-r1/trip.spice
* netlist osc: blocks/g1_osc/sim/qualification/fulltree_r095_load_20260924/common/osc.spice
* netlist gate: blocks/g1_gate/sim/netlist/g1_gate.spice
* WARNING osc: no sch netlist exists for blockset c1414; using the pex netlist
* NOTE bgr: BGR586 source carries 329 historical Sep-19 kpex capacitors, not an extraction of the BGR586 layout
* NOTE trip: NF4 schematic netlist (no parasitics)
* WARNING deviation --inpads nodcn: SENSE_P/SENSE_N use g1_IOPadAnalog_nodcn, a deck-local copy of the PDK sg13g2_IOPadAnalog without its dantenna-based parts (sg13g2_DCNDiode and the SecondaryProtection dantenna D1); clamps, DCPDiode, SecondaryProtection 587 Ohm + dpantenna, ptap resistors and padres kept; VREF pad and PDK file unchanged. Reason: the PDK darea diode model switches formula at -3nVt (measured current step 1e-16->4e-11 A at 78 mV/27 C, 2e-14->2e-10 A at 93 mV/85 C, 1e-12->4e-10 A at 104 mV/125 C), which stalls the transient; removed leakage < 1 nA per pad at 125 C behind the 1 Ohm Kelvin trace (README, Numerical notes).
.param VDDA=3.3 VDD=1.2 IOVDD=3.3 RSH=25m RGND=10m INOM=1 CVREF=1e-08
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_tt
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib hbt_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerDIO.lib dio_tt
.include /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.ref/sg13g2_io/spice/sg13g2_io.spi
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_bgr/layout/coordinated_full_closure/evidence/pex-preparation-20260922-r1/controls/r1/baseline_586.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_trip/sim/qualification/joint586-softinputpair4-nf4-roomcal-s73133-20260924-r1/sense.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_trip/sim/qualification/joint586-softinputpair4-nf4-roomcal-s73133-20260924-r1/trip.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_gate/sim/netlist/g1_gate.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_t2f/sim/postlayout/g1_t2f_pex.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_ctrl/ls/sim/netlist/g1_ls_up.spice
.temp 27
.global sub!
Vsub sub! 0 dc 0
* solver (README, "Numerical notes"): gear integration and loose absolute tolerances are what the PDK IO-pad
* models need when XSPICE events fall on their switching edges (with abstol 1e-9 / vntol 1e-5 the diode
* internal nodes stop converging: "timestep too small"); the DAC mux-tree nodes need rshunt; XSPICE forces
* trtol = 1, which the comparator decisions need at this reltol; default gmin (1e-13 stalls the pads)
.option method=gear itl4=100 reltol=0.001 abstol=1e-10 vntol=1e-6 chgtol=1e-14 rshunt=1e12
.nodeset v(vref_buf)=1.04 v(vped)=1.0008 v(isense)=1.5 v(xsense.vp)=0.047 v(xsense.vn)=0.047 v(iptat)=0.76 v(xsense.xota.out1)=2.51 v(xsense.xota.mir)=2.51 v(xsense.xota.tail)=1.6 v(xsense.xota.fn)=0.2 v(xsense.xota.fp)=0.2 v(xsense.xbuf.out1)=2.51 v(xsense.xbuf.mir)=2.51 v(xsense.xbuf.tail)=1.6 v(xsense.xbuf.fn)=0.2 v(xsense.xbuf.fp)=0.2 v(xsense.xref.out1)=2.51 v(xsense.xref.mir)=2.51 v(xsense.xref.tail)=1.6 v(xsense.xref.fn)=0.2 v(xsense.xref.fp)=0.2
* ---- supplies: one 3.3 V board rail feeds VDDA (pin 7) and IOVDD (pin 3), PLAN D14; 1.2 V VDD (pin 1)
V33 rail33 0 dc 3.3
Vma rail33 vdda_s dc 0
Vmi rail33 iovdd_s dc 0
Rsa vdda_s vdda 0.5
Cda vdda 0 1n
Rsi iovdd_s iovdd 0.5
Cdi iovdd 0 1n
V12 vdd_s 0 dc 1.2
Rsd vdd_s vdd 0.5
Cdd vdd 0 1n
* ---- board: load current profile (1 V = 1 A) x switch on the FET gate node, shunt, Kelvin traces, FET gate
Vprof iprof 0 pwl(0 1 1.6e-05 1 1.602e-05 1.8)
Bload 0 ldi I = v(iprof) * (0.5 + 0.5*tanh((v(gfet) - 1.5)/0.15))
Vim ldi shp dc 0
Rsh shp shn {RSH}
Rgnd shn 0 {RGND}
Rkp shp sense_p 1
Rkn shn sense_n 1
Rg gate gfet 10
Cgate gfet 0 5n
Cfault fault_n 0 20p
* ---- pads (PDK sg13g2_io SPICE models): SENSE_P/N on the bare pad terminal, VREF on the padres terminal
* (587 Ohm secondary protection, padframe/README.md); the VREF bond pad carries the board capacitor CVREF
* ---- deck-local pad copy for --inpads nodcn (PDK sg13g2_io.spi untouched)
.subckt g1_IOPadAnalog_nodcn pad padres vdd vss iovdd iovss
XI0 iovdd iovss pad sg13g2_Clamp_P20N0D
* XI5 iovss pad iovdd sg13g2_DCNDiode   (removed: dantenna x2)
XI2 pad iovdd iovss sg13g2_DCPDiode
* XI3 padres iovss pad iovdd sg13g2_SecondaryProtection   (replaced below without its dantenna D1)
XI3R pad padres sub! rppd R=586.899 l=2u w=1u
XI3P iovss sub! ptap1 R=46.556
XI3D padres iovdd dpantenna l=4.98u w=640n m=1
XI4 iovss pad sg13g2_Clamp_N20N0D
XR0 vss sub! ptap1 R=22.579
XR1 iovss sub! ptap1 R=214.8m
.ends
XPSP sense_p sense_p_res vdd 0 iovdd 0 g1_IOPadAnalog_nodcn
XPSN sense_n sense_n_res vdd 0 iovdd 0 g1_IOPadAnalog_nodcn
XPVREF vref_pad vref vdd 0 iovdd 0 sg13g2_IOPadAnalog
Cvref_ext vref_pad 0 {CVREF}
* digital input pads (EN, SCLK, SDI) as ideal 3.3 V -> 1.2 V level copies: the sg13g2_IOPadIn SPICE
* models abort the event-driven solver at their input edges with the charge tolerance the comparators
* need (README, "Numerical notes"); the pads are functionally verified in blocks/g1_gate (EN pad)
Ben_core en_core 0 V = v(en_pad)*1.2/3.3
Bsclk_core sclk_core 0 V = v(sclk_pad)*1.2/3.3
Bsdi_core sdi_core 0 V = v(sdi_pad)*1.2/3.3
* GATE / FAULT_N output pads as behavioural drivers fitted to the g1_gate block results with the PDK pad
* models (30 mA pad: 5 nF + 10 Ohm, fall 90-10 % 606 ns, arming 0-90 % 677 ns -> 47 Ohm driver; 4 mA pad:
* 20 pF, ~500 Ohm). Reason: README, "Numerical notes" (pad models and the StrongARM comparators need
* incompatible integration settings). The driver switches within 1 ns of gate_core / fault_core and
* draws its current from IOVDD.
Bgate_drv gate_drv 0 V = v(iovdd)*(0.5 + 0.5*tanh((v(gate_core) - 0.6)/0.05))
Rgate_drv gate_drv gate 47
Bgate_i iovdd 0 I = max(0, (v(gate_drv) - v(gate))/47)
Bfault_drv fault_drv 0 V = v(iovdd)*(0.5 + 0.5*tanh((v(fault_core) - 0.6)/0.05))
Rfault_drv fault_drv fault_n 500
Ven en_pad 0 pwl(0 0 3.01431035636e-06 0 3.01521035636e-06 1.485 3.01541035636e-06 1.815 3.01631035636e-06 3.3)
Vsclk sclk_pad 0 pwl(0 0 4.07405957685e-06 0 4.1800344989e-06 0 4.1809344989e-06 1.485 4.1811344989e-06 1.815 4.1820344989e-06 3.3 4.28600942095e-06 3.3 4.28690942095e-06 1.815 4.28710942095e-06 1.485 4.28800942095e-06 0 4.391984343e-06 0 4.392884343e-06 1.485 4.393084343e-06 1.815 4.393984343e-06 3.3 4.49795926505e-06 3.3 4.49885926505e-06 1.815 4.49905926505e-06 1.485 4.49995926505e-06 0 4.6039341871e-06 0 4.6048341871e-06 1.485 4.6050341871e-06 1.815 4.6059341871e-06 3.3 4.70990910914e-06 3.3 4.71080910914e-06 1.815 4.71100910914e-06 1.485 4.71190910914e-06 0 4.81588403119e-06 0 4.81678403119e-06 1.485 4.81698403119e-06 1.815 4.81788403119e-06 3.3 4.92185895324e-06 3.3 4.92275895324e-06 1.815 4.92295895324e-06 1.485 4.92385895324e-06 0 5.02783387529e-06 0 5.02873387529e-06 1.485 5.02893387529e-06 1.815 5.02983387529e-06 3.3 5.13380879734e-06 3.3 5.13470879734e-06 1.815 5.13490879734e-06 1.485 5.13580879734e-06 0 5.23978371939e-06 0 5.24068371939e-06 1.485 5.24088371939e-06 1.815 5.24178371939e-06 3.3 5.34575864144e-06 3.3 5.34665864144e-06 1.815 5.34685864144e-06 1.485 5.34775864144e-06 0 5.45173356349e-06 0 5.45263356349e-06 1.485 5.45283356349e-06 1.815 5.45373356349e-06 3.3 5.55770848554e-06 3.3 5.55860848554e-06 1.815 5.55880848554e-06 1.485 5.55970848554e-06 0 5.66368340759e-06 0 5.66458340759e-06 1.485 5.66478340759e-06 1.815 5.66568340759e-06 3.3 5.76965832964e-06 3.3 5.77055832964e-06 1.815 5.77075832964e-06 1.485 5.77165832964e-06 0 5.87563325169e-06 0 5.87653325169e-06 1.485 5.87673325169e-06 1.815 5.87763325169e-06 3.3 5.98160817374e-06 3.3 5.98250817374e-06 1.815 5.98270817374e-06 1.485 5.98360817374e-06 0 6.08758309579e-06 0 6.08848309579e-06 1.485 6.08868309579e-06 1.815 6.08958309579e-06 3.3 6.19355801783e-06 3.3 6.19445801783e-06 1.815 6.19465801783e-06 1.485 6.19555801783e-06 0 6.29953293988e-06 0 6.30043293988e-06 1.485 6.30063293988e-06 1.815 6.30153293988e-06 3.3 6.40550786193e-06 3.3 6.40640786193e-06 1.815 6.40660786193e-06 1.485 6.407507861